			"notes": "# Mineral Seeds update version 2.1.6\n\n## Update logs\n\n### Mineral Nuggets\n\nIron, Gold, and Copper directly use the existing vanilla nuggets; each of the remaining 9 minerals gets a new nugget.\n\n- 9 new mineral nuggets: 1 corresponding mineral → 9 nuggets; 9 nuggets → 1 mineral\n- Redstone and Glowstone use items displayed as **Redstone Powder / Glowstone Powder**, with dedicated powder textures\n- Copper: 1 Raw Copper → 9 Copper Nuggets; 9 Copper Nuggets → 1 Raw Copper\n- Iron/Gold: use the vanilla “Iron Ingot/Gold Ingot ↔ 9 Iron Nuggets/Gold Nuggets” recipes (crops yield Raw Iron/Raw Gold, which must be smelted into ingots first)\n- Put a full stack (64) of the same Mineral Seed into a single slot in a crafting table → 1 corresponding mineral nugget (all 12 crop types are supported; Iron and Gold produce vanilla Iron Nuggets/Gold Nuggets)\n\n### Gameplay\n\nMineral Seeds can also be placed in a composter (30% chance, same as wheat seeds)."
		},
